{
  "id": "04",
  "title": "AOT 路由引擎",
  "content": "<div style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.12) 0%, rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.04) 100%); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.2); border-left: 4px solid #FFB800; padding: 32px; margin-bottom: 60px; border-radius: 4px; position: relative; overflow: hidden;\"><div style=\"position: absolute; top: -20px; right: -20px; opacity: 0.1; transform: rotate(15deg);\"><svg width=\"120\" height=\"120\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FFB800\" stroke-width=\"1\"><path d=\"M13 2L3 14h9l-1 8 10-12h-9l1-8z\"/></svg></div><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--text-heading); font-weight: 300;\">Photon 的 **AOT 路由引擎** 為大規模應用而生。透過結合預測性基數樹 (Radix Tree) 與編譯時哈希化技術，它能確保您的請求以最少的 CPU 週期到達目標目的地。</p></div><h2>智能調動層 (The Intelligence Layer)</h2><p>路由不僅僅是字串匹配，而是優化查找路徑。Photon 在啟動時會分析您的路由拓撲結構，以選擇最高效的調度策略。</p><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 24px; margin: 48px 0;\" class=\"bento-grid\"><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; border-radius: 4px; transition: all 0.3s ease;\" onmouseover=\"this.style.borderColor='rgba(255,184,0,0.4)'; this.style.transform='translateY(-4px)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.borderColor='var(--border-subtle)'; this.style.transform='translateY(0)'\"> <div style=\"color: #FFB800; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M2 3h6a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v14a3 3 0 0 0-3-3H2z\"/><path d=\"M22 3h-6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v14a3 3 0 0 1 3-3h7z\"/></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; tracking: 0.05em; border: none; padding: 0;\">RADIX_PRECISION</h3><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.8; padding: 0; border: none;\">針對動態片段優化的基數樹。以近乎零的分配成本擷取 <code>:id</code> 或 <code>*wildcard</code> 參數。整合 **Ripple** 實現原生 WebSocket 調度。</p></div><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; border-radius: 4px; transition: all 0.3s ease;\" onmouseover=\"this.style.borderColor='rgba(255,184,0,0.4)'; this.style.transform='translateY(-4px)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.borderColor='var(--border-subtle)'; this.style.transform='translateY(0)'\"><div style=\"color: #FFB800; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M21 2l-2 2m-7.61 7.61a5.5 5.5 0 1 1-7.778 7.778 5.5 5.5 0 0 1 7.777-7.777zm0 0L22 2\"/><path d=\"M15 5.89L18.11 9\"/></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; tracking: 0.05em; border: none; padding: 0;\">AOT_HASHING</h3><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.8; padding: 0; border: none;\">靜態路由會被預先哈希化至查找表中。對於高頻端點，查找效率達到 O(1)。</p></div><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; border-radius: 4px; transition: all 0.3s ease;\" onmouseover=\"this.style.borderColor='rgba(255,184,0,0.4)'; this.style.transform='translateY(-4px)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.borderColor='var(--border-subtle)'; this.style.transform='translateY(0)'\"><div style=\"color: #FFB800; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"9\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"9\"/><line x1=\"9\" y1=\"21\" x2=\"9\" y2=\"9\"/></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; tracking: 0.05em; border: none; padding: 0;\">資源化路由</h3><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.8; padding: 0; border: none;\">聲明式 RESTful 路由。一行代碼即可生成全套優化端點（Index, Store, Show 等）。</p></div></div><h2>具表現力的調度 API</h2><p>Photon 提供了一個流暢的 API，讓您在保持極致執行速度的同時，編寫起來也感到自然直觀。</p><pre><code>// 靜態調度\napp.get('/health', (c) => c.text('OK'))\n\n// 動態參數擷取\napp.get('/users/:id', (c) => {\n  const id = c.req.param('id')\n  return c.json({ id })\n})\n\n// 帶中介軟體的群組邏輯\napp.prefix('/api/v1').middleware(auth).group((routes) => {\n  routes.resource('orders', OrderController)\n})</code></pre><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.05); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.1); border-left: 4px solid #FFB800; padding: 24px; margin: 40px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><h4 style=\"margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 900; color: #FFB800; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em;\">// 路由規格：預測性預熱</h4><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px; font-style: italic; color: var(--text-heading); opacity: 0.9; border: none; padding: 0;\">在應用程式預熱 (Warmup) 期間，Photon 會生成 **路由元數據矩陣**。這使得調度器能夠直接跳轉至處理程序，即使在複雜的巢狀群組中也無需迭代開銷。</p></div><h2>效能基準測試</h2><p>不同路徑複雜度下的吞吐量對比（100+ 靜態路由 vs 20 動態路由）。</p><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; margin: 40px 0; border-radius: 4px;\"><div style=\"margin-bottom: 30px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; color: #FFB800; margin-bottom: 12px; font-family: var(--font-technical);\"><span>PHOTON_AOT_調度</span> <span>約 120k req/s (動態)</span></div><div style=\"height: 8px; background: rgba(255,184,0,0.1); width: 100%; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden;\"><div style=\"height: 100%; width: 95%; background: #FFB800; box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(255,184,0,0.5);\"></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; color: #6B7280; margin-bottom: 12px; font-family: var(--font-technical);\"><span>傳統正則表達式路由</span> <span>約 45k req/s</span></div><div style=\"height: 8px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); width: 100%; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden;\"><div style=\"height: 100%; width: 35%; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);\"></div></div></div><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; font-family: var(--font-technical); border: none; padding: 0;\">// 指標：AOT 交叉匹配比基於 RegEx 的引擎快 2.5 倍</p></div><div style=\"background: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.1), transparent); border-left: 4px solid #10B981; padding: 24px; margin-top: 60px; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; font-style: italic; border: none; padding: 0; color: var(--text-heading);\">**架構師洞察：** 大多數路由器的速度會隨著路由數量的增加而減慢。Photon 的基數樹與哈希混合機制呈對數擴展，確保您的第 1,000 條路由與第 1 條路由一樣快。</p></div>",
